<title>USA: Hand Brand sets 1-for-2 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Hand Brand sets 1-for-2 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI SHORES, Fla. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hand Brand Distribution Inc on Wednesday said it set a 1-for-2 reverse stock split.</p>
<p>After the split, the company said it would have 1.4 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>The company, a direct marketer of health-related products, set a record date of January 31 for the reverse split.</p>
